[node name="Title" parent="Tab/HBoxContainer" index="1"]
text = "Prologue"

[node name="Text" parent="Backdrop/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="0"]
text = "	\"All the springs of the great deep burst forth, and the floodgates of the heavens were opened.\"
	A great deluge has fallen upon the land. Mighty floods sweep away cities. Endless rain pours from the skies.
	Now, all that remains is this little city on a mountaintop. Rather than escape onboard a ship and abandon your people, you have chosen to stay and lead them. Will you build into Heaven and save your people from their fate? Or will you meet a watery grave deep below the limitless sea?"

